Empty generic lists using item_class emit shortened, invalid groups such as rbac/v1 and storage/v1. Add failing tests and derive the wire version from the item class api_version method, preserving undef for invalid/non-API classes. Update Changes.
Resolved in 56a2d74: api_version() now derives the wire version from the item_class's own api_version class method (IO::K8s::Role::APIObject, consults %API_GROUP_MAP) instead of the local lc()-regex. undef for unloadable/non-API classes. t/44_list_api_version.t: 35 tests (wire versions incl. rbac/storage/events/networking/apiextensions/kubeaggregator, serialization, undef paths, kind regression). Full suite PASS (47 files, 3905 tests).
